    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The survey found that a majority of local policymakers anticipate significant societal risks from AI, including increased surveillance, misinformation, and political polarization. However, they also expect positive impacts in areas such as innovation and transportation/infrastructure. <strong>Partisan differences</strong> were observed, with Democrats showing greater support for government regulation and policies addressing specific AI use cases and issues.",
