    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The findings of this survey have important implications for the trajectory of AI regulation in the US. <strong>Capacity-building initiatives</strong> and bipartisan coordination are needed to mitigate policy fragmentation and build a cohesive framework for AI governance. The survey highlights the need for further research to understand the perspectives of local policymakers and to support their efforts in regulating AI.",
